flowchart LR
  Seller[Select seller] --> Preview[Preview worksheet and columns]
  Preview --> Import[Import source rows]
  Import --> Duplicates[Identify reliable duplicates]
  Duplicates --> Select[Select pending order lines]
  Select --> Group[Apply mappings and group]
  Group --> Review[Resolve issues and reconcile]
  Review --> Ready[Approve as ready]
  Ready --> Output[A4 PDF or native print]
  Output --> History[Retain history and backup]
